# Front-end

This Next.js major version has breaking changes versus older training data. Before writing or changing front-end code, read the relevant guide under `frontend/node_modules/next/dist/docs/`. Heed deprecation notices.

For MUI, use current docs (not memorized APIs):

- https://mui.com/material-ui/llms.txt
- https://mui.com/x/llms.txt

Filter UI lives under `frontend/app/filters/`. Follow `frontend/README.md` when adding filters.
